U-Boot that imxrt_install.sh loads over USB to write the FlexSPI NOR flash
of the i.MX RT1170 EVK. It runs from RAM and is never written to the board.

  SPL.sdp         loaded by the boot ROM with blhost load-image
  u-boot-usb.img  loaded by SPL over USB DFU; it exposes the NOR regions
                  spl, u-boot, kernel and rootfs as DFU alternates

Built from https://github.com/EmcraftSystems/u-boot-imx, commit
11999bbc522edb0781d99fd076288cdafbc0bc81, with:

  make imxrt1170-evk-usb_defconfig && make
  cp SPL SPL.sdp && cp u-boot.img u-boot-usb.img

sha256:
